'''Crazed Cow Cat''' (狂乱のウシネコ, ''Kyōran no Ushi Neko'', '''Frenzy Cow Cat''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that first appears in [[Head Shaker (Insane)|Head Shaker]], where he can be unlocked as a [[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cat Unit]]. It was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.3 Update|Version 2.2.3]].

