==Enemy==
Strangely enough, this unit has slower movement speed than [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow Cat]] and it's miles behind the [[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cat Unit]] version. He has very high DPS, but has quite low health and is Single Target.

==Strategy==
A stack of mid-rangers such as [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]] or [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]] with support from [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]] will kill him fast, but be careful of the large numbers! It is usually recommended to stack as many damage dealers as possible to prevent a big stack of Crazed Cows from forming and overrunning the feline frontline.

